14,1,2,talk,Misaki,,I will look at the payment log. I want to see where the friction is.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Mio,,I will check the sunlight and heating needs. It feels unfair right now.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also look at the electrician's quote. I need to know the cost.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Rin,,I will look at the trial run of the reconciliation template.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,I will look at the settling up when the last rooms filled.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
