35,2,1,talk,Mio,,"The rooms are so different. Two need heat from November, the others don't.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"The bills swing wildly. February was 29,000, August was 9,000. A flat rate is risky.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,The template is a nightmare. Keying in every invoice takes hours.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,One room uses four times the energy of another. The old split is definitely wrong.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,The payment log shows late payments after arguments. The cooler notice shows people sweating to save money.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, if the bills swing that much, a fixed rate might hurt us in winter.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, yes. But the electrician quote is 34,000 yen per room. That is a lot upfront.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,"@Shunichi, if one room uses so much, shouldn't they pay more? But who tracks it?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Rin, the monitor data is clear. But fitting meters is expensive.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Mio, the cooler thing was sad. We are already changing our behavior because of this.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,I don't want to sit in a coat. But I don't want to pay for the south rooms' warmth.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The upfront cost for meters is high. Maybe we can't afford that right now.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,The monthly settle at the other house took forty minutes. I don't want that.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,The settling up when rooms filled took three weeks. That is chaos.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,We need something that doesn't require constant arguing.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,I think we need to acknowledge the difference in usage.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am worried about the cash flow. The winter bills are huge.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,I am worried about the time. I don't want to be the accountant.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,I am worried about fairness. The current system is not fair.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I am worried about our relationship. We need to fix this.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
