62,3,1,talk,Rin,,"Option C is the easiest, but it's unfair. Option B is fair but hard to manage.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Option B is the only one that is truly fair. The cost is high, but it's worth it.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option A might reduce the arguments. We know what to expect.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,2,talk,Mio,,"@Ryuji, do you think we can handle the year-end settle for Option A?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
66,3,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Mio, it's a lot of work, but it's once a year. Better than monthly fights.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
