69,3,2,talk,Misaki,,I think Option A is the most realistic. It smooths out the peaks.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
70,3,3,talk,Mio,,I agree with Misaki. Option A feels safer for our peace of mind.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
71,3,3,talk,Ryuji,,I am leaning towards Option A. The data shows the swings are too big for a flat share.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
72,3,3,talk,Rin,,"I am worried about the year-end work, but I hate the current system more.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
73,3,3,talk,Shunichi,,"I still prefer B, but I see the financial barrier.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
74,3,3,talk,Misaki,,Let's go with A. It's a compromise.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
